          "id": "d91c7fcc-4b72-46cd-8020-8405f2dac403",
          "attributes": {
            "description": "CadetCatch helps Coast Guard Academy families keep up with cadet photos without digging through every gallery by hand.\n\nCreate a private roster on your iPhone, add approved photo pages, check those pages for possible face matches, review match details, view selected results, save likely finds, and keep simple notes for family follow-up.\n\nCadetCatch checks only photo pages you add or enable. Private albums stay private unless you choose to share an accessible link.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://eb28.co/cc/privacy/\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "keywords": "cadet,coast guard,academy,photos,family,parents,roster",
            "marketingUrl": "https://eb28.co/cc/",
            "promotionalText": null,
            "supportUrl": "https://eb28.co/cc/support/",
            "whatsNew": "Restores the build 57 CadetCatch update with private roster setup, approved public photo sources, hidden result previews, saved finds, family notes, and purchase restore controls."
          },
